  "html": "<div id=\"questionExplanation-237555\" class=\"questionExplanation\" style=\"display: block;\"><p>We proceed as follows:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>First, we split each whole into sixths.</li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"graphic-7dd54d1b07a51866611a9aa0a07b6469\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/7dd54d1b07a51866611a9aa0a07b6469\"></div> \n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Next, we create groups of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"151\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mstyle style=\"color: red;\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c36\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle></mjx-texatom></mjx-mstyle></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"red\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mstyle></mrow><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"graphic-816184ce26f33f3d52beff456bb05214\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/816184ce26f33f3d52beff456bb05214\"></div> \n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Then, we count the groups.</li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"graphic-9dd97a6180d702d4068aa108aa6f2090\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/9dd97a6180d702d4068aa108aa6f2090\"></div> \n\n<p>So, if we divide <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"